sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant W as Next.js Web
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Redis/BullMQ
  participant K as Worker
  participant S as OpenSearch
  participant N as Notification Provider

  U->>W: Submit listing form
  W->>A: POST /v1/listings/{id}/submit + Idempotency-Key
  A->>D: Begin transaction
  A->>D: Validate ownership, form schema, plan and state
  A->>D: Update listing to SUBMITTED
  A->>D: Insert moderation case if needed
  A->>D: Insert outbox events
  A->>D: Commit
  A-->>W: 202 transition response
  K->>D: Poll/claim outbox row
  K->>Q: Enqueue moderation/index/notification jobs
  K->>D: Mark outbox published
  K->>K: Automated text/image/risk checks
  K->>D: Publish or leave pending review
  K->>S: Upsert public search document when published
  K->>N: Send status notification
  W-->>U: Show submitted/published status
